"show-figure\">right left through</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr>         <tr class=\"a2b2 \">\n             <td></td>\n             <td class=dance-show-beats>8</td>\n             <td><div class=\"show-figure\">star left 4 places to new <u>neighbors</u> ⁋</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tr></table>\n<div class=\"dance-show-notes\"><div class='contra-markdown-block'><p>6-7-16</p>\n</div></div>\n<p class=\"dance-show-publish\">\n            shared everywhere\n          </p>\n"
